# REST

## LOGIN
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}

###

## Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "confirmPassword": ""
}

###

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

###

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer 